# Cloudflare Pages rules for duki.chadmurchison.com.
# SPA fallback: there is no 404.html, so unknown paths get index.html with 200 (CloudFront: 403/404 -> /index.html, 200).
# Serve /index.html in place instead of Pages' 308 to / (it is a registered Cognito callback URL).
# Never redirect to another host: guest data lives in IndexedDB on https://duki.chadmurchison.com.
/index.html  /  200
